engine. Its crates are licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuda-rust/blob/e84e5b3d74014fcca36ffcf1b8d603c197cc7c8f/LICENSE
Dependency copyright notices and licenses remain with the upstream crates.

The official Gorilla BFCL and MMMU evaluators and llama.cpp comparison executable are
external validation tools. Their code, data, model weights and run artifacts
are not included in this repository.

Sampling algorithm reference: Yaniv Leviathan, Matan Kalman, and Yossi Matias,
Fast Inference from Transformers via Speculative Decoding (ICML 2023),
https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.17192. Sample-and-match verification specializes
speculative sampling to deterministic draft proposals.
